<p><strong>具体要求：</strong></p>
<p>1）每位学生安排床位3～5张。每日8:00AM及14:00PM进病房。</p>
<p>2）入科前一周的周五准备示教病例，给学生分配床位。</p>
<p>3）入科第一天早上告诉学生：哪几位病人进行床旁示教，并分好询问汇报病史的同学和体检的同学；什么病例进行病例讨论，哪一天进行；哪一天进行特殊检查或操作的示教；由哪几位同学做报告；若时间充裕可安排半日门诊观摩。</p>
<p>4）建议安排半日进行特殊检查或操作，内容如下：心：心电图；肺：肺功能检查；消化：内镜；血液：骨髓检查；肾病：透析治疗；内分泌：血糖测定或胰岛素治疗。各科派专人负责特殊检查和操作示教。</p>
<p>5）每科结束前，每位学生书写病史（中文大病史、英文入院录）各一份交给带教老师。其中，急诊科只需完成英文入院录即可。中文大病史应该手写；英文入院录可以打印，也可手写。带教老师应及时修改反馈。</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 14pt;"><strong>考核和评价方式</strong><strong>： </strong></span></p>
<p><strong>平时成绩（50%）+理论考核（50%）</strong></p>
<p><strong>理论考核：</strong>闭卷，占50%权重。题型包括选择题、问答题（含临床病例分析）等，考核学生基础知识的掌握及初步应用能力。</p>
<p><strong>形成性评价：</strong>占50％权重。包括学生在理论授课中的出勤率、讨论活跃度、课后作业完成情况等；床旁带教则由带教老师根据学生表现，从以下5个方面进行打分。</p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000;" border="1" width="574">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="136">
<p><strong>形成性评价内容</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="438">
<p><strong>具体要求</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="136">
<p>纪律及课程参与度</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="438">
<p>包括出席率，讨论活跃度等</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="136">
<p>病史询问和医患沟通</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="438">
<p>病史询问参与情况和表现</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="136">
<p>体格检查</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="438">
<p>每个轮转科室按要求内容分配学生进行体格检查，由老师/学生进行讨论纠错，老师打分。</p>
<p>各科安排（供参考，具体以带教老师安排为准）:</p>
<p>心内-心脏体检+测血压；</p>
<p>呼吸-胸部体检；</p>
<p>消化-腹部体检</p>
<p>内分泌-甲状腺+神经系统</p>
<p>肾内-四肢+头面部</p>
<p>风湿-头面部+脊柱关节</p>
<p>血液-全身浅表淋巴结</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="136">
<p>中英文病史书写</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="438">
<p>每个科室出科前完成1份中文大病史（<strong>手写</strong>）和1份英文入院录（手写或打印），由带教老师批阅后修改；</p>
<p>急诊科只需完成英文入院录；</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="136">
<p>学生报告</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="438">
<p>1.心内、呼吸、消化、肾内四个科室将安排学生进行学生报告，每次由2~4人合作轮流完成，保证每位同学在6周的床旁教学中参与1次学生报告；</p>
<p>2.报告主题、内容不限，由学生自查文献、分共合作、讨论汇总，并在出科前最后1天进行会议报告，由老师打分。</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
